  "id": "BIT-parse-2026-116162",
  "summary": "Parse Server 9.0.0 before 9.10.5 Privilege Escalation via SMS MFA Login",
  "details": "Parse Server before 8.6.104 and 9.0.0 before 9.10.5 saves the entire login request with master privileges when issuing an SMS multi-factor authentication verification code. An SMS MFA-enrolled user can include extra fields in that request to modify master-key-restricted fields on their own account, such as the email-verification flag or beforeSave-protected values.",
